OL,3,GNEWSABoy's skate park campaign prompts 
OL,4,Alandowner appeal                       
OL,6,FLandowners in a town in Derbyshire have
OL,7,Fbeen urged to come forward with        
OL,8,Fpotential sites after a young boy      
OL,9,Flaunched a campaign to build a skate   
OL,10,Fpark.                                  
OL,12,FDan, from Melbourne, said he started   
OL,13,Fthe campaign because he currently has  
OL,14,Fto rely on his dad to take him to the  
OL,15,Fnearest parks, which are about 20      
OL,16,Fminutes away.                          
OL,18,FHe has taken his campaign to local     
OL,19,Fpoliticians, including South Derbyshire
OL,20,FMP Samantha Niblett, but has been      
OL,21,Funable to find a suitable site for the 
OL,22,Fdevelopment.                           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
